    <description>On create or Edit of Opportunity, if there is a gift commitment record with grant reports that are not submitted, update the guardian and grant reporter, and grant reporter email address. Creatde by Arkus (BL) 3-5-25
Added collection variable for the grant reports in the loop.
Added Opportunity Guardian Email as a field to populate in the Assignment element. Arkus (BL) 3-19-25</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>stores the grant reporter first name and last name</description>
        <name>f_txt_GrantReporterName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Opportunity_Grant_Reporter__r.FirstName} &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp;
{!$Record.Opportunity_Grant_Reporter__r.LastName}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
